{"title":"Raft in two acts","sub":"Five servers. Under each: its term, then its log ([bracketed] = not yet committed).","kind":"graph","interval":2800,"scenarioLabel":"Show","legend":[["a","leader"],["b","candidate"],["good","vote or acknowledgement"],["muted","crashed"]],"graph":{"w":380,"h":290,"r":22,"nodes":[{"id":"S1","x":190,"y":25,"sub":"below"},{"id":"S2","x":290,"y":98,"sub":"below"},{"id":"S3","x":252,"y":215,"sub":"below"},{"id":"S4","x":128,"y":215,"sub":"below"},{"id":"S5","x":90,"y":98,"sub":"below"}],"edges":[{"u":"S1","v":"S2"},{"u":"S1","v":"S3"},{"u":"S1","v":"S4"},{"u":"S1","v":"S5"},{"u":"S2","v":"S3"},{"u":"S2","v":"S4"},{"u":"S2","v":"S5"},{"u":"S3","v":"S4"},{"u":"S3","v":"S5"},{"u":"S4","v":"S5"}]},"scenarios":[{"name":"Leader election","frames":[{"caption":"Five servers. S1 is the leader for term 1 (blue). Its heartbeats tell the followers it is alive. Under each server: its current term, then its log. Entry x is committed.","nodes":{"S1":{"cls":"a","sub":"t1  x"},"S2":{"sub":"t1  x"},"S3":{"sub":"t1  x"},"S4":{"sub":"t1  x"},"S5":{"sub":"t1  x"}},"edges":{"S1-S2":"a","S1-S3":"a","S1-S4":"a","S1-S5":"a","S2-S3":"hide","S2-S4":"hide","S2-S5":"hide","S3-S4":"hide","S3-S5":"hide","S4-S5":"hide"},"stats":[]},{"caption":"S1 crashes. The heartbeats stop. Each follower is waiting with its own <b>random</b> election timeout, between 150 and 300 ms.","nodes":{"S1":{"cls":"muted","sub":"down"},"S2":{"sub":"t1  x"},"S3":{"sub":"t1  x"},"S4":{"sub":"t1  x"},"S5":{"sub":"t1  x"}},"edges":{"S1-S2":"hide","S1-S3":"hide","S1-S4":"hide","S1-S5":"hide","S2-S3":"hide","S2-S4":"hide","S2-S5":"hide","S3-S4":"hide","S3-S5":"hide","S4-S5":"hide"},"stats":[["Timeouts (ms)","S2 231, S3 162, S4 284, S5 207"]]},{"caption":"S3's timer fires first, at 162 ms. It becomes a <b>candidate</b>: it moves to term 2, votes for itself, and asks everyone else for a vote.","nodes":{"S1":{"cls":"muted","sub":"down"},"S2":{"sub":"t1  x"},"S3":{"cls":"b","sub":"t2  x"},"S4":{"sub":"t1  x"},"S5":{"sub":"t1  x"}},"edges":{"S1-S2":"hide","S1-S3":"b","S1-S4":"hide","S1-S5":"hide","S2-S3":"b","S2-S4":"hide","S2-S5":"hide","S3-S4":"b","S3-S5":"b","S4-S5":"hide"},"stats":[["Votes","1 of 5"]]},{"caption":"S2, S4 and S5 have not voted in term 2 yet, and S3's log is at least as up to date as theirs, so each grants its vote. S1 is down and says nothing.","nodes":{"S1":{"cls":"muted","sub":"down"},"S2":{"sub":"t2  x"},"S3":{"cls":"b","sub":"t2  x"},"S4":{"sub":"t2  x"},"S5":{"sub":"t2  x"}},"edges":{"S1-S2":"hide","S1-S3":"hide","S1-S4":"hide","S1-S5":"hide","S2-S3":"good","S2-S4":"hide","S2-S5":"hide","S3-S4":"good","S3-S5":"good","S4-S5":"hide"},"stats":[["Votes","4 of 5 (needs 3)"]]},{"caption":"A majority voted for S3, so it is the leader of term 2. Each server votes only once per term, so no other server can also have won term 2. The other timers were reset by S3's heartbeats before they could fire.","nodes":{"S1":{"cls":"muted","sub":"down"},"S2":{"sub":"t2  x"},"S3":{"cls":"a","sub":"t2  x"},"S4":{"sub":"t2  x"},"S5":{"sub":"t2  x"}},"edges":{"S1-S2":"hide","S1-S3":"hide","S1-S4":"hide","S1-S5":"hide","S2-S3":"a","S2-S4":"hide","S2-S5":"hide","S3-S4":"a","S3-S5":"a","S4-S5":"hide"},"stats":[]}]},{"name":"Partition","frames":[{"caption":"S3 leads term 2. A client sends y. S3 appends it to its own log, uncommitted (in brackets), and sends AppendEntries to everyone.","nodes":{"S1":{"sub":"t2  x"},"S2":{"sub":"t2  x"},"S3":{"cls":"a","sub":"t2  x [y]"},"S4":{"sub":"t2  x"},"S5":{"sub":"t2  x"}},"edges":{"S1-S2":"hide","S1-S3":"a","S1-S4":"hide","S1-S5":"hide","S2-S3":"a","S2-S4":"hide","S2-S5":"hide","S3-S4":"a","S3-S5":"a","S4-S5":"hide"},"stats":[]},{"caption":"Once a majority (S3 plus at least two others) have y in their logs, it is <b>committed</b>. Only now does the client hear \"success\".","nodes":{"S1":{"sub":"t2  x y"},"S2":{"sub":"t2  x y"},"S3":{"cls":"a","sub":"t2  x y"},"S4":{"sub":"t2  x y"},"S5":{"sub":"t2  x y"}},"edges":{"S1-S2":"hide",